    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i guess it depends on how much i use it for work then right? like if i use it sometimes for gaming too, does that mess up the deduction? i just don't want the irs coming after me for miscategorizing stuff because it feels like a bit of a grey area.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
