      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try to keep some kind of log. honestly though last year i felt like some money just... vanished from my accounts? like i'd account for everything but then a few hundred bucks would be missing and i couldn't find where it went in quickbooks. it felt so weird, almost like the money was being stolen or something. do you have any advice on how to prevent those kinds of discrepancies in my bookkeeping?",
